		"protocol": "Trunk (`main`) is woven by Tartan. Never push it. Work in your lane; push early and often; read `remote: tartan ▸` lines;\nread the `tartan-notices` block at the end of every tool result; call `changes_submit` when your acceptance criteria pass;\na change that conflicts at land time comes back to you with both intents.\n",
